The system admin team at xFusionCorp Industries has streamlined access management by implementing group-based access control. 
Here's what you need to do:

a. Create a group named nautilus_developers across all App servers within the Stratos Datacenter.

b. Add the user mohammed into the nautilus_developers group on all App servers. If the user doesn't exist, create it as well.

SOLUTION
The task involves configuring multiple servers in the Stratos Datacenter. Since each server maintains its own local users and groups, you must repeat the following steps on every App server (stapp01, stapp02, stapp03).

